|{{SquadAutoRow|date=2024-01-05|displaydate=January 5th|text='''100 Thieves''' extend [[eeiu]]'s  contract until the end of 2025, according to the VCT Global Contract Database. <ref name="eeiu contract extended">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ScanVCT/status/1743389421783675005|title=DANIEL "eeiu" VUCENOVIC has been added to 100 THIEVES with a 2025 contract |date=2024-01-05 |author=[[VCT Contract Updates]]}}</ref>}}
|{{SquadAutoRow|date=2024-01-08|displaydate=January 8th|text='''100 Thieves''' sign [[Boostio]] from [[Evil Geniuses]]. <ref name="100T Boostio">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/100T_VAL/status/1744456784805568767|title=Let's get you out of there, @Boostio|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2024-01-08}}</ref><ref name="EG Boostio to 100T">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/EvilGeniuses/status/1744516970018447545|title=We’re saying farewell and most of all, THANK YOU, to @Boostio...|author=[[Evil Geniuses]]|date=2024-01-08}}</ref>}}
