|{{SquadAutoRow|date=2024-08-14|displaydate=August 14th|text=[[Zikz]] extends his contract until 2027. <ref name="+Zikz 2027">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/100T_VAL/status/1823796746344128997|title=The mastermind is sticking around|author='''100 Thieves'''|date=2024-08-14}}</ref>}}
