'''Fnatic''' is a professional esports organization based in London, United Kingdom.

==History==
===Timeline===
{{TimelineSquadAuto
|{{SquadAutoRow|date=2021-08-06|displaydate=August 6th|text=[[Magnum]] extends his contract until 2024. <ref name="Magnum contract extended 2024">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FNATIC/status/1423700024291176460|title=Get ready for more lurks, frags, and 1HP aces - we've extended @just_magnum's contract until 2024! |date=2021-08-06 |author='''Fnatic'''}}</ref>}}
|{{SquadAutoRow|date=2022-03-30|displaydate=March 30th|text=[[BraveAF]] is suspended from the roster during an internal investigation by '''Fnatic'''. <ref name="BraveAF suspended">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FNATIC/status/1509253627340374017|title=An update regarding BraveAF. |date=2021-03-30|author='''Fnatic'''|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>}}
