|{{SquadAutoRow|date=2022-09-21|displaydate=September 21st|text='''Fnatic''' is announced as a "'''VCT Partner Team'''", joining the EMEA International League on a four-year contract. <ref name="2023 Partner Teams">{{cite web|url=https://valorantesports.com/vct-teams|title=2023 VALORANT TEAMS REVEAL|date=2022-09-21|author='''[[Riot Games]]'''}}</ref>}}
|{{SquadAutoRow|date=2024-02-16|displaydate=February 16th|text=[[Boaster]] extends his contract until 2025. <ref name="Boaster contract extended 2025">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FNATIC/status/1758446316479267100|title=We're thrilled to announce we've extended @OfficialBoaster until 2025!|date=2024-02-16|author='''Fnatic'''}}</ref>}}
|{{SquadAutoRow|date=2024-02-22|displaydate=February 22nd|text=[[Alfajer]] extends his contract until 2026. <ref name="Alfajer contract extended 2026">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FNATIC/status/1760717505528476102|title=We're excited to announce that we've extended @Alfajervl's contract until 2026!|date=2024-02-22|author='''Fnatic'''}}</ref>}}
