|{{SquadAutoRow|date=2024-01-16|displaydate=January 16th|text='''Fnatic''' sign [[EsportsRyan]] as Performance Coach. <ref name="EsportsRyan joins">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FNATIC/status/1746966320560619879|title=We're excited to announce that @EsportsRyan joins both our LEC and VCT squads as Performance Lead on a fixed-term contract!|date=2024-01-16|author='''Fnatic'''}}</ref>}}
