*They were the only team to qualify for every Champions tournament from its inception through 2025.
*First organization to reach 2 million {{Abbr/USD}} in earnings.
*They are tied with [[Paper Rex]] as the teams with the most international Grand Finals appearances in '''VCT''' history, with 5 as of 2026.

